        },
        "message": "Add marketing research: platforms, posting automation, crypto channels\n\nmarketing/ covers 29 platforms (social, video, community, crypto-native):\nofficial posting APIs, cost and limits, native and API scheduling,\nsupported schedulers, Siri Shortcuts methods, paid crypto ad policies and\nautomation risks, as a CSV/JSON dataset plus a summary table and a write-up\nper platform. Also: Shortcuts recipes (Telegram, Discord, Bluesky,\nMastodon, Threads, WhatsApp, Farcaster, Binance Square), scheduler / API /\nno-code comparison, crypto listing and ad channels, and promotion rules\n(FTC, UK FCA, EU MiCA). Researched 2026-10-07; sources listed, with\nunverified items marked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
